item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/31052607a7e8a786ed65aed9319f862f.avif?t=1771967369\" width=300 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Levels and Expert Tracks unlock from 'Race Wins' and 'Season Calendar Positions'.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Roots.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reference to the Game: Supercars 1 &amp; 2 on the Amiga, this could be considered a remake with more hand drawn, hand painted artwork with enhanced destructible environments and increased difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Overall.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrillingly fast, top-down 2d racer that blends lovingly detailed scenery with wanton destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Special Newbies Driving Note.</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The car turns on it's axis. It has no reverse gear. If you hit a wall front on, Stop (Use Brakes) and Twist on the spot.</i></p>","developers":["CORSO"],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/9f55ee05b442138662474a8603c347f9f344a708/header.jpg?t=1771967369","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3713790/884052/08d69580c171713f9973ef058a72e79af7ab4459/1750389487/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746824041","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3713790/884052/08d69580c171713f9973ef058a72e79af7ab4459/1750389487/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746824041","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akam